{"product_id":"nietzsches-beyond-good-and-evil-a-readers-guide-readers-guides","title":"Nietzsche's 'Beyond Good and Evil': A Reader's Guide (Reader's Guides)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBeyond Good and Evil contains Nietzsche's mature philosophy of the free spirit. Although it is one of his most widely read texts, it is a notoriously difficult piece of philosophical writing. The authors demonstrate in clear and precise terms why it is to be regarded as Nietzsche's philosophical masterpiece and the work of a revolutionary genius.This Reader's Guide is the ideal companion to study, offering guidance on:- Philosophical and historical context- Key themes- Reading the text- Further reading\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Christa Davis Acampora | Keith Ansell Pearson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780826473646\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890774991001,"sku":"14RB9780826473646","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9780826438331.jpg?v=1763047352","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/nietzsches-beyond-good-and-evil-a-readers-guide-readers-guides","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}